<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thank You for Your faithfulness.</l><l>I have seen Thy preciousness.</l><l>Now, Lord, I can’t deny</l><l>Your beauty has captured my heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now, Lord, You’re all I want.</l><l>I waste all that I have.</l><l>No one compares to You.</l><l>Here in love, Lord, will I remain.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
